---
description: >-
  Composite-state diagram (a nested "Working" state) under the
  "redux-dark-color" redux colour theme, exercising compositeTitleBackground and
  altBackground — theme variables that a flat state diagram wouldn't touch.
config:
  theme: redux-dark-color
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Working: start
  state Working {
    [*] --> Fetching
    Fetching --> Parsing: bytes ready
    Parsing --> [*]
  }
  Working --> Idle: done
  Working --> Failed: error
  Failed --> Idle: retry
  Failed --> [*]
